{"step_index":200,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T15:39:28Z","input_tokens":3229,"cache_read_tokens":130040,"output_tokens":27680,"thinking":"Successful synchronization of the built application indicates a stable base. The next step involves verifying the presence of any standalone HTML entry points or user portals directly accessed through a web browser, considering previously identified files like those related to web interfaces and terminal access. Examining these HTML files will confirm their intended function and integration into the user's workflow.\n\n\nInitial focus is on transforming the identified HTML file into a fully standalone, interactive showcase. This requires integrating essential assets: a CSS framework, icon library, and audio handling, alongside a comprehensive member dataset.\n\nThe target functionality demands interactive elements: turnstile simulation, WhatsApp integration, digital credential display, client dossier, new client form, renewals, and view switching. These must function entirely offline.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\" class=\"dark\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Cartera de Clientes & Membresías • FITNESS LEGENDS PRO GYM</title>\n  \n  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  \n  <!-- SheetJS for 1-click Excel Export -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/xlsx@0.18.5/dist/xlsx.full.min.js\"></script>\n\n  <!-- Google Fonts: Montserrat & Inter -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n  <script>\n    tailwind.config = {\n      darkMode: 'class',\n      theme: {\n        extend: {\n          fontFamily: {\n            sans: ['Montserrat', 'sans-serif'],\n            mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n          },\n          colors: {\n            gym: {\n              bg: '#09090C',\n              card: '#121217',\n              surface: '#181822',\n              border: '#272733',\n              muted: '#9CA3AF',\n              gold: '#F59E0B',\n              goldHover: '#D97706',\n              emerald: '#10B981',\n              crimson: '#EF4444',\n              purple: '#A855F7',\n            }\n          },\n          boxShadow: {\n            'glow-gold': '0 0 25px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4)',\n            'glow-green': '0 0 25px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35)',\n            'glow-red': '0 0 25px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35)',\n            'glow-purple': '0 0 25px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35)',\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n\n  <style>\n    body {\n      background-color: #09090C;\n      color: #F4F4F6;\n      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      overflow-x: hidden;\n      background-image: \n        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 15%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05) 0%, transparent 40%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 85%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.04) 0%, transparent 45%);\n    }\n\n    /* Custom high-tech scrollbar */\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n      width: 7px;\n      height: 7px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n      background: #0d0e13;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n      background: #272838;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n      background: #f59e0b;\n    }\n\n    .badge-halo-active {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);\n    }\n    .badge-halo-expiring {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);\n    }\n    .badge-halo-expired {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);\n    }\n\n    @keyframes pulseGlow {\n      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.9; transform: scale(1); }\n      50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.96); }\n    }\n    .pulse-glow {\n      animation: pulseGlow 2s infinite ease-in-out;\n    }\n\n    /* Print styling */\n    @media print {\n      body * {\n        visibility: hidden;\n      }\n      #printArea, #printArea * {\n        visibility: visible;\n      }\n      #printArea {\n        position: absolute;\n        left: 0;\n        top: 0;\n        width: 100%;\n        background: white !important;\n        color: black !important;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"p-3 sm:p-6 lg:p-8\">\n\n  <!-- Audio Synthesizer Engine -->\n  <script>\n    class SoundEngine {\n      constructor() {\n        this.ctx = null;\n      }\n      init() {\n        if (!this.ctx) {\n          const AudioContext = window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext;\n          if (AudioContext) this.ctx = new AudioContext();\n        }\n        if (this.ctx && this.ctx.state === 'suspended') {\n          this.ctx.resume();\n        }\n      }\n      playGranted() {\n        try {\n          this.init();\n          if (!this.ctx) return;\n          const now = this.ctx.currentTime;\n          const notes = [\n            { freq: 523.25, time: 0.00, dur: 0.2 },\n            { freq: 659.25, time: 0.08, dur: 0.2 },\n            { freq: 783.99, time: 0.16, dur: 0.24 },\n            { freq: 1046.50, time: 0.24, dur: 0.5 },\n          ];\n          notes.forEach(({ freq, time, dur }) => {\n            const osc = this.ctx.createOscillator();\n            const gain = this.ctx.createGain();\n            osc.type = 'sine';\n            osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(freq, now + time);\n            gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.25, now + time);\n            gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, now + time + dur);\n            osc.connect(gain);\n            gain.connect(this.ctx.destination);\n            osc.start(now + time);\n            osc.stop(now + time + dur);\n          });\n        } catch(e) {}\n      }\n      playDenied() {\n        try {\n          this.init();\n          if (!this.ctx) return;\n          const now = this.ctx.currentTime;\n          const osc = this.ctx.createOscillator();\n          const gain = this.ctx.createGain();\n          osc.type = 'sawtooth';\n          osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(160, now);\n          osc.frequency.linearRampToValueAtTime(110, now + 0.35);\n          gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.3, now);\n          gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, now + 0.35);\n          osc.connect(gain);\n          gain.connect(this.ctx.destination);\n          osc.start(now);\n          osc.stop(now + 0.38);\n        } catch(e) {}\n      }\n      playBlip() {\n        try {\n          this.init();\n          if (!this.ctx) return;\n          const now = this.ctx.currentTime;\n          const osc = this.ctx.createOscillator();\n          const gain = this.ctx.createGain();\n          osc.type = 'triangle';\n          osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(700, now);\n          osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(1100, now + 0.06);\n          gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.2, now);\n          gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, now + 0.06);\n          osc.connect(gain);\n          gain.connect(this.ctx.destination);\n          osc.start(now);\n          osc.stop(now + 0.07);\n        } catch(e) {}\n      }\n    }\n    const audio = new SoundEngine();\n  </script>\n\n  <!-- Container -->\n  <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-6\">\n\n    <!-- FLOATING ACCESS NOTIFICATION TOAST -->\n    <div id=\"accessToast\" class=\"fixed top-5 right-5 z-50 transform translate-y-[-150%] transition-transform duration-300 p-4 rounded-2xl border shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md max-w-md flex items-start gap-3 pointer-events-none\">\n      <div id=\"toastIcon\" class=\"p-2 rounded-xl shrink-0\"></div>\n      <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n        <h4 id=\"toastTitle\" class=\"font-black text-sm flex items-center justify-between\"></h4>\n        <p id=\"toastBody\" class=\"text-xs text-zinc-300 mt-0.5 leading-snug\"></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 1. TOP HEADER BANNER (Legends Gym Pro Brand & Live Hardware Status) -->\n    <header class=\"relative bg-gradient-to-r from-[#14151c] via-[#101117] to-[#181924] p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-3xl border border-gym-border shadow-xl overflow-hidden\">\n      <!-- Ambient Lighting -->\n      <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -mr-20 -mt-20\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-1/3 w-64 h-64 bg-emerald-500/5 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-5\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-black font-black text-xl shadow-glow-gold\">\n              FL\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-wide uppercase\">\n                  Cartera de Clientes & Membresías\n                </h1>\n                <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase\">\n                  FITNESS LEGENDS\n                </span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gym-muted mt-0.5\">\n                Administración de expedientes, vigencias, enrolamiento biométrico y renovaciones.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Hardware & Real-Time Status -->\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 mt-3.5 flex-wrap text-xs\">\n            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 roun